{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5c9bd6c9d1c0aaa95cf7b637dc34ce99fbe5e25526e0b71a69f5f3e0521bf700", "ja": "#茜ちゃんがまさかの#衝撃#ズッ友だよね", "zh": "#小茜做出惊人举动#冲击#永远是朋友吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a6e32d998833731b00331f50b65685182c5373a431746c7e0ff17bf02204f8fd", "ja": "#劇場で#公演の思い出を語る一同。感極ま\nった様子で席を外す#茜だったが、内緒で販\n売したグッズの収入を数えていた。ショック\nを受ける#ロコ。プロデューサーが気を利か\nせて売上を回収、#茜の名誉は守られた。", "zh": "大家在#剧场谈论着#公演的回忆，表现出\n深受感动且热泪盈眶的模样而离席的#茜，\n竟是瞒着大家在偷数贩售周边所获得的收入。\n#ROCO大受打击，而制作人临机应变\n将营收拿回去，保住了#茜的名声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4def67de5258678dac94ee5b2c051f3628bff594d002f4a51639b5cf0fc73980", "ja": "（劇場に戻って数日経ったものの、\nメンバーはまだ、地方公演の話題で持ちきりだ）", "zh": "（回到剧场已经过了好几天，\n成员聊天的话题依然围着地方公演打转。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "18fb060f48cc1bd111f56c487e6eabe2f503d8bc2af175a570ae383414c1b1a5", "ja": "地方公演、ホンマ楽しかったわ～！\n劇場以外のとこでやんのも、ええな♪", "zh": "地方公演真的好开心呀～！\n在剧场以外的地方表演也挺不错的吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "fe8838856fd1f7a5a40c3e41243e238211817dfb78d5f2f8888a47010218d7d1", "ja": "客席もみんな、盛り上がってましたよね！　ありさも\n客席から見たかったですけど、ガマンしました！", "zh": "观众们也都很热情呢！\n虽然亚利沙也很想在观众席上看表演，不过忍住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "efddba60fb1837dc4ae114749ad7c2d594cecd81e389d40b426fc73a024ab798", "ja": "公演も楽しかったけど、その前の\n『AKANE★CHANNEL』も楽しかったねぇ。", "zh": "公演是很开心没错，不过在那之前的\n《AKANE★CHANNEL》也很开心哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "d13ac26a74f2defc8a7240eba16b061d875cda93e29691ed3e9e96541f283fe3", "ja": "もう公演とか関係なしで番組を続けるのはどうかニャ？\nせっかく、視聴者数も増えたコトだし……。", "zh": "干脆把节目独立出来继续做下去怎么样喵？\n好不容易观众人数也变多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "aa8ca07547963320fbac60d66c0a12e8402002ae1439e3dffadff14427cc0d5b", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nもしかして、また公演の話をしてたのか？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n你们该不会又在聊公演了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "77c6d5640487dc24a06b7f09e034591c482450da6a33928a3d43a668931229a8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　そうなんです、\nこれからのことをディスカッションしてたんですよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！被你说中了。\n其实ROCO我们正在Discussion今后的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "1d08e4d3d8793f7c0517ad8c44b42abae70d3a015542a1d70ef83a59093cd160", "ja": "はい！　せっかくお客さんもついたコトですし、\n生放送を続けるのはどうかって、茜ちゃんが。", "zh": "是的！小茜说好不容易都有固定收看的观众了，\n要不要把直播节目继续做下去这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "499071f1c3ededc41895bc254d5c41700d01563b93266f3f53bc875731005c6b", "ja": "スケジュールとか平気なんやったら、いいんちゃう？\n{$P$}さんは、どう思います？", "zh": "行程那些没问题的话，应该可以吼？\n{$P$}先生觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ba7f4cf08f5a7cee5f093254917ca1718ed150b55a5360bfb060a74ebce80aa0", "ja": "そうだな。続けるとなると、スケジュールもだけど\n機材とか人とか、色々考えないとだな。", "zh": "这个嘛，如果要继续的话，除了行程之外，\n还得考虑到器材啊人事成本那些问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "6650b28fded7483f2445782c1f3857ae4acbbc3230ad8e90dc2957017ddc5f03", "ja": "せっかくだから、続けられるといいねぇ。\nそしたら収穫した野菜で、お料理もできるべさ♪", "zh": "难得有这个节目，真希望可以继续下去呢。\n这样我也能用收成的蔬菜来做料理给大家看了哪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "598f408a47529c298e0dbbc2ee7fde6ee1f9e864e152166cc21f5c8ee52f2c19", "ja": "ひなたちゃんの手料理！\nそれはアリかもしれませんね～！", "zh": "日向亲手做的菜！\n感觉很可以呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "b890f7275ac0fce07e9f5b39c7aecfd332c95f5456099caa899d4f5c039a3cd6", "ja": "今回の公演は、アイドルのパーソナリティが\nケミカルリアクションしたってロコは思います！", "zh": "ROCO认为，这次公演Idol的Personality\n起了Chemical reaction！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed11d58bd66de88fafc3680dac26f2f3d94a980e83bd1f0eb9af731464c352da", "ja": "うんうん！　誰が欠けても起きなかった、奇跡の\nステージ！　茜ちゃんは、茜ちゃんは……ううっ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！这是少了任何一人就无法完成的奇迹表演！\n小茜、小茜……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "7f1e4009e0bd8bbcc52bd9c416fcb763246f888b11f605249e4cf216ee2f7e5a", "ja": "茜ちゃん、ちょっと涙拭いてくるね……！", "zh": "小茜去擦一下眼泪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "3401b1936aa8a0c5f4a4a4d78644e7cf04a099f3f1dd390d8f3532ff836ddbdf", "ja": "あ、アカネ！", "zh": "茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2d1eef381a953ac5875640e9d8bcf0830c3563a52318c52a91a2104af85b759e", "ja": "茜？　そんなに感動して……\nいや、待てよ？　今の感じは……！", "zh": "茜？她竟然这么感动……\n不对，等一下喔？刚才那感觉是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "d8a9078f38cc1193addde8c11ecb5de66806f34ffd8adceba16daad256316bd0", "ja": "ひい、ふう、みい、よ……。\nクックックッ……！　想像以上の実入り……！", "zh": "一、二、三、四……\n呵呵呵……！收入比想像中还多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "46106ee9bca061fe82ccb17ac825682ca619321bb669c44fe6cbf72e3e4323a5", "ja": "茜ちゃんとロコちゃんの新作マスコットに、\n元祖茜ちゃん人形……いやー、売れた！　売れたよ！", "zh": "小茜跟ROCO的新吉祥物以及始祖小茜娃娃……\n哎呀～大热卖！大热卖啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "297b5c1949c486ffa5f7ef7f5b1d2ac1298f55f02ab77c5a39ecfc18162d01a3", "ja": "これぞプロモーションの醍醐味！\n笑いが止まらないとは正にこのコト……はっ！？", "zh": "这才是宣传最大的乐趣！\n所谓的笑得合不拢嘴就是在形容此时……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "0bca1ad7e68c621ceb76cdb91b2f7b4070231a94e5fd7c531a2c7d201591f630", "ja": "あ、アカネ！　そのマネーは！？", "zh": "茜！那些Money是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bb948eb4fd6fb2daeda4b503a44f66cdeb7f51a8219704a1e6a6722ef3ad0ca3", "ja": "茜……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "5930edc93bc51d240eeff6fbb660d86861dcbbac147f6e76adfe6840ef4e6636", "ja": "ギャー！　ろ、ロコちゃん！？\nついでに{$P$}ちゃんまで！？", "zh": "哇──！小、小ROCO！？\n怎么连小{$P$}都在！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "68f1a21367e5dbf233d85e0289323a829414cc88b560724ecdd2c001622c26ac", "ja": "アカネ……まさか公演のプロモーションも、\nマスコットも、全部マネーのためだったんですか……？", "zh": "茜……难道公演的Promotion和Mascot，\n全部都是为了Money所做的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "778a592e56fa01d07a537b77ba2f5d203f96d9aa8592381ada61f0f03eb37552", "ja": "い、いや、違……わないけど！\nだってそのホラ、プロモーションにはお金がいるし！？", "zh": "没、没有，不……是这样没错啦！\n因为那个你们也知道，宣传需要花钱嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "18943ef269dd6c696993c21e513f29b9bb4730e1d1997d64748a7d6bf865ff7a", "ja": "ああ、そうか！　茜は今回のプロモーション費の\n赤字を埋めるために、グッズに力を入れてくれたのか！", "zh": "啊啊，原来如此！茜是为了填补\n这次宣传费的赤字，才投入心力在周边上的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5418e8b33446ce8d60ac0b4bbaa9c5a0f42b594418b157fc7fba10c8aec30f5e", "ja": "機材とか配信で、かなり掛かったもんな。\nありがとう、助かるよ！", "zh": "毕竟准备器材和直播花了很多钱嘛。\n谢谢你，真是帮了大忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "9e9549f90d906bc01aed4a789e039554083b749b8d56e3fd324753587b898b43", "ja": "へっ、えっ？　{$P$}ちゃん、\nそ、それは……！", "zh": "咦、什么？小{$P$}，\n这、这个嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6eeff1d08aaa6780f92a216e31002f34331c1e4d4066c04fc3f524f8820bbabb", "ja": "違うのか？　なら、律子に聞いてみようかな。\nプロモーション費用の計算を手伝ってもらってるんだ。", "zh": "难道不是吗？不然我去问一下律子好了，\n其实我有请她帮忙计算宣传费用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "694a88da631171bf5e103f532ade536b03375f70f68f399129f983acbae9d21d", "ja": "違わないでーーーーーす！！！！\n茜ちゃん、赤字を埋めるためにがんばりました！！！", "zh": "你说的没错────！！！！\n小茜为了填补赤字付出了很多努力！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "1359671a1ccebd65ac29d435a0df1d19483eeb946a2ec319e7925696f7e7445a", "ja": "はいこれ、納品書と売上表！\n……くっ。", "zh": "来，这是出货单跟营收明细！\n……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "68a042f01a12676a7c21349e1e398aea7e7a2f20999fc11d09be6bd0ce96e275", "ja": "お、ありがとう。\nうん、ちょうどぴったりくらいだな。", "zh": "哦，谢谢。\n嗯，金额刚刚好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "7bd619121977f7a28ec642cb6fd8b9cebe94fd466d2f41921f27ca7d72c5c4b6", "ja": "そうだったんですか……！　さすがアカネです！\nビジネスプランまでパーフェクトなんですね♪", "zh": "原来是这样……！不愧是茜！\n连Business的Plan都很Perfect呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "8cc9f27cc6086161c402d926690533d24ed031d12bd3a3e5d2c1f65a72529a5a", "ja": "う、うん……ありがとね、ロコちゃん。茜ちゃんに\n遺されたのは、ロコちゃんの笑顔だけだったよ……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……谢啦，小ROCO。\n小茜还拥有的只剩小ROCO的笑容了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "af8bcdbc18f29475ca2e1bf6cda196745b8583815b3e5e4683ca95d65e965e58", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！　こうなったら\n茜ちゃんに早く、一刻も早く、次のお仕事入れてね！", "zh": "小{$P$}！既然如此，\n你要快点安排下一个工作给小茜，越快越好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "f84765ca598b5effb38f90fdd252c73a0f4f2fa7e28eccb717c8e0caf3cb4d85", "ja": "茜ちゃんは次回こそ、アメリカンドリームを\nつかんでみせるよ！　約束だからねーっ！！", "zh": "小茜下次一定会变成大富婆给你们看的！\n说好啰──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "128b2f8ff9037530282f85d3a3a6f0e025cb9acf580ff8bfbca82ef094c94d5e", "ja": "（色々と問題も起こすけど……茜のこういう才能も、\nそしてロコの才能も、ちょっと他には見当たらない）", "zh": "（虽然会惹出一些麻烦……但茜的这种才华，\n还有ROCO的才华都是可遇不可求的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0089_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0089_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "6d939f079c98eeeb29284b50892052e9ca045558581c50ce0b3cf3687bb914c3", "ja": "（普通のアイドルの枠に収まりきらないふたりの魅力、\nこれからもファンの人達に届けていかないとな！）", "zh": "（跳脱出一般偶像框架的两个人，\n今后也要将她们的魅力传达给粉丝才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
